Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.90,0:00:13.15,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}A sunny Sunday's early afternoon;
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.15,0:00:16.53,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}where should we go today?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.33,0:00:22.91,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}The same old road that I'm so used to walking on...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.91,0:00:28.00,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}...shines with a dazzling light.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.71,0:00:32.63,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}If I have the warm sunlight shining down on me...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.88,0:00:37.93,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}...and you by my side...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.73,0:00:48.06,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}My feelings are ready to burst forth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.40,0:00:53.15,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}Sing out, lai lai lai!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.15,0:00:58.37,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}My voice reaches every corner of the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.66,0:01:03.58,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}I'm already high, high, high!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.58,0:01:09.21,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}Riding the whirling winds...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.21,0:01:13.59,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}Sing out, lai lai lai!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.01,0:01:19.51,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}My voice swoops up and down with me.
